<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal pension fund assets rise Q1 1997.</title>
<headline>Portugal pension fund assets rise Q1 1997.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese pension fund assets rose 5.26  percent year-on-year to 1.68 trillion escudos in the first quarter  of 1997, the Association of Pension Fund Management (AEGFP) said.</p>
<p>Direct investment in shares rose to 11.2 percent of total assets,  it added.</p>
<p>Investment in state bonds and bills represented 37 percent of portfolios  with other bonds accounting for 27.2 percent.</p>
<p>($1=186 escudos)</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
